\"><div class=\"flex w-full items-center border-b border-r border-gray-dark py-3 pl-2 text-xs font-normal underline\"><span class=\"h-5 w-5 min-w-[20px] bg-cover bg-no-repeat\"><img alt=\"img\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"https://cci2.oddsportal.com/sport_icons/soccer.svg\"/></span><a class=\"ml-2 w-auto\" href=\"/football/europe/champions-league/\">Champions League</a></div><div class=\"flex w-full items-center border-b border-r border-gray-dark py-3 pl-2 text-xs font-normal underline\"><span class=\"h-5 w-5 min-w-[20px] bg-cover bg-no-repeat\"><img alt=\"img\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"https://cci2.oddsportal.com/sport_icons/soccer.svg\"/></span><a class=\"ml-2 w-auto\" href=\"/football/europe/conference-league/\">Conference League</a></div><div class=\"flex w-full items-center border-b border-r border-gray-dark py-3 pl-2 text-xs font-normal underline\"><span class=\"h-5 w-5 min-w-[20px] bg-cover bg-no-repeat\"><img alt=\"img\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"https://cci2.oddsportal.com/sport_icons/soccer.svg\"/></span><a class=\"ml-2 w-auto\" href=\"/football/europe/europa-league/\">Europa League</a></div><div class=\"flex w-full items-center border-b border-r border-gray-dark py-3 pl-2 text-xs font-normal underline\"><span class=\"h-5 w-5 min-w-[20px] bg-cover bg-no-repeat\"><img alt=\"img\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"https://cci2.oddsportal.com/sport_icons/soccer.svg\"/></span><a class=\"ml-2 w-auto\" href=\"/football/spain/laliga/\">LaLiga</a></div><div class=\"flex w-full items-center border-b border-r border-gray-dark py-3 pl-2 text-xs font-normal underline\"><span class=\"h-5 w-5 min-w-[20px] bg-cover bg-no-repeat\"><img alt=\"img\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"https://cci2.oddsportal.com/sport_icons/soccer.svg\"/></span><a class=\"ml-2 w-auto\" href=\"/football/italy/serie-a/\">Serie A</a></div></div><div class=\"p-3\"><a href=\"/events/\" class=\"flex text-xs font-normal underline\">All events</a></div></section></div><script>$RS(\"S:18\",\"P:18\")</script><script>$RC(\"B:a\",\"S:a\")</script><div hidden id=\"S:11\"><div class=\"flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"order-2 z-20 m-2 flex self-start border border-gray-light px-[10px] py-[5px] text-[10px] font-bold uppercase leading-3 text-[#FF9800] min-mm:hover:bg-orange-main min-mm:hover:text-white-main\">Show more</button><div class=\"order-1 cms_homepage relative flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-col pt-5 font-main text-xs text-black-main [&amp;_a]:text-[#3598db] [&amp;_a]:underline hover:[&amp;_a]:no-underline [&amp;_h1]:pb-2.5 [&amp;_h1]:font-secondary [&amp;_h1]:text-[28px] [&amp;_h1]:font-semibold [&amp;_h1]:leading-[34px] [&amp;_h1]:text-black-main [&amp;_h2]:pb-2.5 [&amp;_h2]:pt-2.5 [&amp;_h2]:font-secondary [&amp;_h2]:text-[19px] [&amp;_h2]:font-semibold [&amp;_h2]:leading-7 [&amp;_h2]:text-black-main [&amp;_h3]:flex [&amp;_h3]:items-center [&amp;_h3]:gap-1 [&amp;_h3]:pb-1.5 [&amp;_h3_span]:flex [&amp;_h3_span]:items-center [&amp;_h3_span]:gap-1 [&amp;_li]:ml-3.5 [&amp;_li]:list-disc [&amp;_p]:pb-2 [&amp;_ul]:flex [&amp;_ul]:gap-1 [&amp;_ul]:text-[#3598db] [&amp;_ul:last-of-type]:block [&amp;_ul:last-of-type]:text-[#3598db] cms_homepage_en after:pointer-events-none after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:z-10 after:mb-2 after:h-36 after:w-full after:bg-gradient-to-t after:from-white-main after:via-white-main/90 after:to-transparent after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;]\"><h2><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">OddsPortal - Your Source for Betting Odds and Odds Comparison</span></h2><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">OddsPortal is your go-to platform for comparing betting odds from leading bookmakers. Whether you're betting on local leagues or international tournaments, our website helps you find the top odds to increase your chances of winning.</span></p><h2><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Your ultimate source for live odds, betting markets, and real-time comparison of odds from top bookmakers worldwide</span></h2><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">We provide the latest odds across a wide variety of sports and markets. Whether you're a seasoned bettor or new to sports betting, our odds comparison tool helps you make informed decisions and secure the best possible returns.</span></p><h2><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Why Use OddsPortal?</span></h2><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">OddsPortal gives you all that you could need for an enhanced betting experience, and to ensure that you receive the biggest payouts possible on your bets.</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Primarily, you will get the best sports betting odds from our recommended online bookmakers, and this can be enjoyed across multiple sports and markets, pre-match and in-play, while you can also appreciate the convenience of the tools through your mobile device.</span></p><h3><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><strong>Get the Best Betting Odds</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">First and foremost, we guarantee that you get the best betting odds for whichever sport or market you are looking to bet on. Ranging from betting on the top divisions to smaller leagues or events, you will find sports betting odds for all types of tournaments.</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Thanks to odds comparisons from the best online bookmakers, we ensure that players are getting the best betting odds, which will result in a bigger payout if their bet is to win.</span></p><h3><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><strong>Compare Odds Across Multiple Bookmakers</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> Whichever region you are playing from, there are multiple bookmakers with odds for each of the sporting events and the betting markets available on our site. This means that you can compare odds across several bookmakers to get the best betting odds for single bets, or combinations.</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">With the real-time odds comparison we have on offer, you can quickly find the best betting odds for the sports and specific event or events you are interested in wagering on, whether they are in-play or yet to start.</span></p><h3><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><strong>Access to Multiple Sports &amp; Betting Markets</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">There are 20 sports available for you to choose from to find odds comparisons on OddsPortal, with numerous markets available for each of them, including both individual matches and outrights.</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Betting markets and odds comparison can be found for all of the most well-known sports like <a href=\"../../../football/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">football</a></span>, <a href=\"../../../tennis/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">tennis</a> and <a href=\"../../../basketball/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">basketball</a>, but also for more niche sports like Aussie rules, futsal, and more.</p><h3><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><strong>Stay Updated with Live Scores and Results</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">In addition to pre-match markets being available, you can also find live odds and keep up to date with live scores in your favourite leagues or tournaments.</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Our fast real time data provides you with live scores immediately after a goal is scored, point is won, or basket is scored. Having all of this information at your fingertips, and <a href=\"../../../inplay-odds/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">live odds</a></span> available for matches in-play, enables you to alter your pre-match bets with the best odds available, or lock in some value during a match.</p><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Our results and standings pages allow you to keep track of competitions on a match by match basis, and how they are performing over the season.</span></p><h3><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><strong>Mobile-Friendly</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">You can explore and enjoy odds comparison on your mobile device, allowing you to place wagers with the best betting odds from anywhere. Whether you are at home or on the go, our dynamic, live odds are available on OddsPortal both pre-match and in-play.</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Moreover, to ensure you are placing your bets with all the information you need, we have mobile-friendly results and standings pages that give you a better indication of previous form for teams or players.</span></p><h2><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Elevate Your Sports Betting Game With Oddsportal&rsquo;s Betting Tools</span></h2><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">OddsPortal has a number of betting tips and tools that might help bring attention to some interesting markets you may have never thought about betting on before, ensuring to bring you the best betting odds as always.</span></p><h3><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><img src=\"https://oddsportal-main-storage.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/kwuSlsWYa9gaGQtoyKhwOw5VptgtMYZbfZA6gAec.png\" alt=\"Dropping Odds\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /> </span><strong><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\">Dropping Odds</span></strong></h3><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">The <a href=\"../../../dropping-odds/#overall\">dropping odds</a> page demonstrates when a team, player, or market&rsquo;s odds have dropped before the start of a match. This will provide you better visibility about when an online bookmaker might be reducing odds due to circumstances only they are aware of ahead of a match, essentially giving you some betting tips.</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">You can also filter the page to see dropping odds from the last hour, 12 hours, or 24 hours, the percentage of bookies who have dropping odds, and a particular market you might be interested in betting on.</span></p><h3><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><img src=\"https://oddsportal-main-storage.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/08Qh0WfSnYr8Z0AeCMF51fUlsgyd5stVInkDIUhq.png\" alt=\"Value Bets\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /> </span><strong><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\">Value Bets</span></strong></h3><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">If you are looking strictly for value and a way to get ahead of the bookmakers, the <a href=\"../../../value-bets/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">value bets</a></span> page provides you with some bets with mathematically calculated value. The odds of a bookmaker are compared with the total average odds of the same outcome to illustrate markets with unique value, and probability also included.</p><h3><img style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\" src=\"https://oddsportal-main-storage.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/kwuSlsWYa9gaGQtoyKhwOw5VptgtMYZbfZA6gAec.png\" alt=\"Sure Bets\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /><strong><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\">Sure Bets</span></strong></h3><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Our <a href=\"../../../sure-bets/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">sure bets</a></span> page is exactly what you would imagine, a way for you to win guaranteed profit, or sure money, by betting on two different outcomes. You can see the calculated stakes for each outcome by entering how much you want to wager in total, and the profit you will make.</p><h3><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><img src=\"https://oddsportal-main-storage.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/WQlWmJ6kTsUyAjfwLbyiKiGwS5fMoLYRAugp4tqL.png\" alt=\"Blocked Odds\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /></span><strong><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\">Blocked Odds</span></strong></h3><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">On the <a href=\"../../../blocked/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">blocked odds</a></span> page, you will be able to see matches or markets that online bookmakers are no longer providing odds for, which you can use to your advantage with betting sites that have yet to remove odds or notice changes in the market.</p><h3><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><img src=\"https://oddsportal-main-storage.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/xt374s6nIbO0Z7dT7tCZKs9kplUOCR395bl0tGDT.png\" alt=\"Bet Calculator\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /> </span><strong><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\">Bet Calculator</span></strong></h3><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Perfect for those of you who are new to sports betting, our <a href=\"../../../bet-calculator/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">bet calculator</a></span> will demonstrate the payout of your bet if you are unsure of how sports betting odds work. This could be for a simple single bet, accumulator, and by decimal, fractional, or American odds depending on your preference.</p><h3><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><img src=\"https://oddsportal-main-storage.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/KqEkFWX3XG4WQ8gTwsbw49Cm2BaiZLqV0zGgtRMC.png\" alt=\"Results\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /> </span><strong><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\">Results</span></strong></h3><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">A great betting tool is to check back on archived <a href=\"../../../results/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">results</a></span> for the teams or players involved in the match you are looking to bet on, and we offer that across all of the leagues and tournaments worldwide. The best betting odds are provided for those results too, indicating who might be of value heading into their next match based on recent form.</p><h3><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><img src=\"https://oddsportal-main-storage.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/JzTQidm3xXFsMh2k1VA6xRosVvb4BZagq0SssNOF.png\" alt=\"Standings\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /> </span><strong><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\">Standings</span></strong></h3><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">We have all of the <a href=\"../../../standings/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">standings</a></span> available for you in one place for all of the football leagues worldwide, both the top leagues and even the small, local leagues.</p><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Head to our standings page to pick out the league you are interested in and see how the table currently looks, with you also being able to filter to see home form, away form, and over a specific amount of matches.</span></p><h2><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Wide Range of Sports &amp; Leagues Available for Betting</span></h2><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Whichever sport you are looking to bet on, OddsPortal has an extensive list of markets and odds available for each of them. Providing odds comparisons for the biggest and smallest leagues and tournaments in the world, you can bet with better knowledge and using the best odds from our recommended online bookmakers.</span></p></div></div></div><script>$RC(\"B:11\",\"S:11\")</script><div hidden id=\"S:9\"></div><script>$RC(\"B:9\",\"S:9\")</script><div hidden id=\"S:1\"></div><script>$RC(\"B:1\",\"S:1\")</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"9a:I[944520,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1c903j7c2wxjq.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3_faonkpnif-a.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0qal4luc1-ona.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0x0ps82tzzera.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/336375_d-ridk.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0h9izan-bqvt1.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1emz9mq3jem1q.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3pzoes1x92xo3.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0li_offttbsjl.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2vk2x12v5b2g8.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1jacg7fhtmm0_.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3ncq_wryp6dxu.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/4288q2adoxdqa.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n99:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"main-bgcolor font-primary mb-3 text-white-main\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"main-bgcolor border-b border-gray-dark p-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-base font-bold uppercase leading-5\\\"