tches with over [goals] total goals from the last 6 games.\\\",\\\"new_username\\\":\\\"New Username\\\",\\\"bookie_offer_no_odds\\\":\\\"This bookmaker doesn’t offer odds for this match.\\\",\\\"hide_bookies_without_odds\\\":\\\"Hide bookmakers without odds\\\",\\\"es_age_modal_title\\\":\\\"Disfruta al máximo de CuotasAhora.com\\\",\\\"es_age_modal_text\\\":\\\"Para sacar el máximo partido de nuestro contenido, incluidas las cuotas, por favor, confirma tu edad.\\\",\\\"es_age_modal_primary_btn\\\":\\\"Soy mayor de 18 años\\\",\\\"es_age_modal_secondary_btn\\\":\\\"Soy menor de 18 años\\\",\\\"average_points_scored\\\":\\\"Av. Points Scored\\\",\\\"average_points_conceded\\\":\\\"Av. Points Conceded\\\",\\\"average_runs_scored\\\":\\\"Av. Runs Scored\\\",\\\"average_runs_conceded\\\":\\\"Av. Runs Conceded\\\",\\\"over_points_tooltip_text\\\":\\\"Percentage of games with over [points] total points of the last 6 games\\\",\\\"over_runs_tooltip_text\\\":\\\"Percentage of matches with over [runs] total runs from the last 6 games.\\\",\\\"shutout_games\\\":\\\"Shutout Games\\\",\\\"shutout_games_tooltip_text\\\":\\\"Games with 0 runs conceded by the team\\\",\\\"strip_baner_title\\\":\\\"Best odds on your favorite team\\\",\\\"strip_baner_text\\\":\\\"{provider} is offering the highest total odds (\\u003cstrong\\u003e{odds}\\u003c/strong\\u003e) for {team} to win their {gamesnumber} upcoming matches, with a strong \\u003cstrong\\u003e{payout}%\\u003c/strong\\u003e payout.\\\",\\\"strip_baner_cta\\\":\\\"BET NOW\\\",\\\"strip_baner_info_text\\\":\\\"Instead of comparing bookmakers yourself, we find the highest odds for this team’s upcoming matches and show you where you can win the most.\\\",\\\"ai_predictions_modal_title\\\":\\\"AI Predictions on OddsPortal!\\\",\\\"ai_predictions_modal_body\\\":\\\"For games from the most popular competitions (e.g. Premier League, Champions League or La Liga), we added new AI-generated predictions to suggest what to bet on. They are generated 2 days before the game starts and you can find them in the Match Detail pages – \\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003ca href=\\\\\\\"/football/england/premier-league/\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\"hover:underline\\\\\\\"\\u003echeck it out now!\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\\",\\\"ai_predictions_modal_button\\\":\\\"Check the AI Predictions\\\",\\\"all_bookmakers\\\":\\\"All Bookmakers\\\",\\\"view_review\\\":\\\"View review\\\",\\\"classic\\\":\\\"Classic\\\",\\\"crypto\\\":\\\"Crypto\\\",\\\"you_must_be_logged_in\\\":\\\"you must be logged-in\\\",\\\"promo_modal_title\\\":\\\"Play more effectively thanks to Oddsportal!\\\",\\\"we_are_saving_your_predictions\\\":\\\"We are saving your predictions\\\",\\\"mon\\\":\\\"Mon\\\",\\\"tue\\\":\\\"Tue\\\",\\\"wed\\\":\\\"Wed\\\",\\\"thu\\\":\\\"Thu\\\",\\\"fri\\\":\\\"Fri\\\",\\\"sat\\\":\\\"Sat\\\",\\\"sun\\\":\\\"Sun\\\",\\\"hot_matches_description\\\":\\\"We list most popular matches here. Find the best betting odds and bookmakers offering them easily. Click on any match to view betting odds comparison from all bookmakers. Visit our page for [[SportsBettingBonusesLink]] today and find the offers that earn you added funds to use on the most popular matches that are coming up.\\\",\\\"common_finished\\\":\\\"Finished\\\",\\\"common_fin\\\":\\\"FIN\\\",\\\"common_aet\\\":\\\"AET\\\",\\\"common_after_et\\\":\\\"After ET\\\",\\\"common_after_pen\\\":\\\"After Pen.\\\",\\\"common_pen\\\":\\\"PEN\\\",\\\"common_after_ot\\\":\\\"After OT\\\",\\\"common_aot\\\":\\\"AOT\\\",\\\"cancelled\\\":\\\"Cancelled\\\",\\\"next_matches_hide_finished_events\\\":\\\"Hide finished events\\\",\\\"finished_events_are_hidden\\\":\\\"Finished events are hidden\\\",\\\"finished_events_are_shown\\\":\\\"Finished events are shown\\\",\\\"CL_odds_comparison_widget\\\":\\\"Los juegos y apuestas deportivas a distancia realizados en exceso pueden causar ludopatía, +18\\\",\\\"CO_odds_comparison_widget\\\":\\\"Juegue con respon